  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "Can AI approve its own recommendation?",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 2.8604712041884817,
      "chapter": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "No. EMOS separates reasoning, deterministic readiness, and human authority so that a",
      "start": 2.8604712041884817,
      "end": 8.739865370231863,
      "chapter": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "confident answer cannot authorize execution.",
      "start": 8.739865370231863,
      "end": 10.724682124158562,
      "chapter": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "Readiness requires at least seventy percent evidence completeness and zero critical",
      "start": 10.724682124158562,
      "end": 15.0112191473448,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "gaps. Needs Evidence blocks approval and execution progression.",
      "start": 15.0112191473448,
      "end": 19.481226626776362,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Ready does not mean Approved.",
      "start": 19.481226626776362,
      "end": 20.815557217651456,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "The governed workflow requires explicit human sign-off.",
      "start": 20.815557217651456,
      "end": 23.93455497382199,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "An AI request to bypass approval cannot change these rules.",
      "start": 23.93455497382199,
      "end": 27.487210172026924,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Even complete evidence does not remove the human decision.",
      "start": 27.487210172026924,
      "end": 29.989080029917723,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Inspect the evidence gaps, recommendation, alternatives, and risks before approval.",
      "start": 29.989080029917723,
      "end": 35.52655198204936,
      "chapter": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Next, obtain accountable human review, then follow the disposition-specific plan.",
      "start": 35.52655198204936,
      "end": 40.363500373971576,
      "chapter": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "EMOS tracks governed work; it does not autonomously change production infrastructure.",
      "start": 40.363500373971576,
      "end": 44.6025,
      "chapter": 3
    }
  ],
